start-message = 👋 <b>Hi! I'm EZChart</b>

    📸 Send me a <b>chart screenshot</b> (any timeframe, any instrument) and I'll do a quick technical analysis.

    <b>What I can do:</b>
    • Identify trend and key levels
    • Estimate Risk/Reward
    • Explain logic in simple language

    ⚠️ <i>I don't give financial advice. This is an educational tool.</i>

help-message = 📸 <b>How to use:</b>
    1. Take a chart screenshot from TradingView / MT4 / MT5 / any app
    2. Send it here as a photo
    3. Get analysis in 5-10 seconds

    <b>Commands:</b>
    /start — start
    /help — this help
    /language — change language

    ⚠️ <i>Disclaimer: not financial advice.</i>

about-message = 📊 <b>EZChart</b> — Trading analysis made EZ.

    Screenshot → analysis in 5 seconds.

    🔧 <b>Stack:</b> aiogram 3.x + Gemini 3.6 Flash
    📦 <b>Open source:</b> https://github.com/1369777-svg/ezchart-bot

    Made with ❤️ for beginner traders.

analysis-in-progress = 🔍 <i>Analyzing chart...</i>

error-unreadable = ❌ <b>Could not recognize the chart.</b>

    Try:
    • A clearer screenshot
    • Crop extra UI elements
    • Make sure axes and candles are visible

error-ai-unavailable = ⚠️ <b>Analysis error.</b>

    Possible reasons:
    • Temporary AI model unavailability
    • Free-tier request limit exceeded

    Try again in a minute.

error-generic = ⚠️ <b>Something went wrong.</b> Please try later.

throttled = ⏳ <b>Too fast.</b> Please wait <b>{ $seconds } sec</b> before the next analysis.

send-photo-please = 📸 <b>I need a chart screenshot.</b>

    Take a screenshot from TradingView or your terminal and send it as a photo.

send-as-photo = 📸 Send the chart as a <b>photo</b> (not a file).

    In Telegram: attach → choose "Photo" or take a screenshot.

language-prompt = 🌍 <b>Выберите язык / Choose language / Scegli la lingua:</b>

language-button-ru = 🇷🇺 Русский
language-button-en = 🇬🇧 English
language-button-it = 🇮🇹 Italiano

